{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から7月ですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/01/7268489/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ夏休みだ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもその前にテストがあります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/01/7268489/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影と期末の期間がいろいろ重なってて大変だけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく単位を落とさないように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出来る範囲で精一杯がんばります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/01/7268489/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヾ(●｀・ω・´●)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前のゆび祭りのとき楽屋も食堂も広いとこでみんな一緒で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和気あいあいと楽しくしていたのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふと見たら、なんか怖そうなパンクロッカーの一団が(( ；゜Д゜..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わっ目合わせない方がいいのかなって思ってたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「乃木坂姉さん、私立恵比寿中学です。よろしくお願いします！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"て可愛い声であいさつされちゃいましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/01/7268489/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえいえ、こちらの方が後輩ですし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も中学4年生ですし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エビ中姉さん、こちらこそどうぞよろしくお願いします<(_ _)>"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"放課後ゲタ箱ロッケンロール♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭の中で鳴ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/01/7268489/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他のアイドルの方たちとの合同ライブはとても楽しくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい刺激にもなったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またぜひやれたらいいな（*^_^*）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の乃木どこは私の得意なクッキングです(｀・ω・´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/01/7268489/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと乃木坂浪漫"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2回目またやらせていただきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7月3日放送"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宮沢賢治『セロ弾きのゴーシュ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったら見てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/01/7268489/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、今発売中のブブカに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんと載せていただいてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/01/7268489/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わちゃわちゃと仲良く取材を受けました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気の向くままに生駒氏と色んな会話をしたので、よかったら見